260
00:20:17,550 --> 00:20:18,030
Speaker 1: No problem.

261
00:20:18,210 --> 00:20:20,730
Then you, you continue maintaining awareness there.

262
00:20:20,790 --> 00:20:23,130
It's wisdom come, it's naturally later.

263
00:20:23,970 --> 00:20:25,830
Don't think too much because dangerous.

264
00:20:28,590 --> 00:20:33,990
One time, no, one time I, I saw the two yogi in Australia, in Malaysia.

265
00:20:35,310 --> 00:20:43,350
After 10-day retreat, they said they crossed the red line, red line, because they concentrate too much.

266
00:20:43,830 --> 00:20:46,590
10-day concentrate, the mind cannot think about the meaning.

267
00:20:47,970 --> 00:20:49,410
So the red line they cross.

268
00:20:50,190 --> 00:20:50,790
Very dangerous.

269
00:20:51,690 --> 00:20:53,490
That's why I said don't focus too much.

270
00:20:53,730 --> 00:20:55,290
This not for vipassana.

271
00:20:55,710 --> 00:20:57,990
Vipassana is the wisdom, only wisdom walk.

272
00:20:58,350 --> 00:21:00,210
